{"unit_id":"AaronandWork__dsh-evidence-gate#card-zh","repo":"AaronandWork/dsh-evidence-gate","commit":"845ddf415e045eb6b2a014bca97a9c63aee1befa","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-evidence-gate（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为关键结论提供基于证据的判定与会话记录。它注册证据层级提示段、结论核验工具、会话开关命令和 Web 控件；可对直接观察类依据与记录的工具活动交叉核对，并维护可查看的会话判定台账。适合希望在 DSH 中审阅关键结论依据并查看核验记录的用户。运行需要 Node.js 18 或更高版本，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1186-1438","lib/client.mjs:739-753"]}
{"unit_id":"AaronandWork__dsh-evidence-gate#card-en","repo":"AaronandWork/dsh-evidence-gate","commit":"845ddf415e045eb6b2a014bca97a9c63aee1befa","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-evidence-gate is a DSH web plugin for checking important claims against evidence. It adds a session-aware policy, verdict tools, a switch and report command, plus web controls. Direct-observation claims can be matched with recorded tool activity. It requires Node.js 18 or later and no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1186-1438","lib/client.mjs:739-753"]}
